On 2026-10-17 Windows Authenticode verification of the bundled driver returned
Valid. The DLL is not Authenticode-signed. Runtime hash checks establish that
extracted files match this bundle; they do not check for upstream updates or
certify compatibility with other drivers.

The files are extracted alongside this notice before use. They remain separate
shared-library files on disk; they are not statically linked into Lantern.
To use an interface-compatible modified WinDivert library, supply its absolute
directory with lantern.WindowsGatewayOptions.DriverDirectory. This explicit
override bypasses the bundled-file hashes. Administrator rights and a Windows
accepted driver signature are still required by Windows where applicable.
Modification of WinDivert and reverse engineering to debug those modifications
are permitted under the supplied license. No WinDivert service is automatically
removed or upgraded by Lantern.
